   "harm": "repeating verbose template instantiations for non-null smart pointers makes call sites hard to read and adopt",
   "hash": "3adcddd1bb33b9e7",
   "history": [
    {
     "at": "2026-09-18T03:27:11+00:00",
     "blocking": true,
     "by": "run:20260918-0314",
     "cause": "rc:3292627623",
     "status": "resolved"
    }
   ],
   "id": "rc:3292627623",
   "kind": "interface",
   "pin": null,
   "quote": "Could we avoid repeating the verbose template instantiation for all non-null smart pointers? I like the extra guarantee, but I don't like how verbose the results are.",
   "settled_by": {
    "at": "2026-06-02",
    "by": "l0rinc",
    "id": "r:4408797759",
    "quote": "ACK fae0a346c1ea2c96160448f660b37749d695265e"
   },
   "status": "resolved",
   "url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34844#discussion_r3292627623"
  },
  {
   "association": "MEMBER",
   "at": "2026-07-10",
   "author": "stickies-v",
   "author_replies": [
    "rc:3602420437"
   ],
   "blocking": false,
   "fix": {
    "at": null,
    "sha": "fa0e12e77bb90bef05bfd8a960e1a28673b575be"
   },
   "harm": "carrying a customized third-party GSL base introduces unnecessary complexity and maintenance burden",
   "hash": "e028a5e9d9f6c5cb",
   "history": [
    {
     "at": "2026-09-18T03:27:11+00:00",
     "blocking": false,
     "by": "run:20260918-0314",
     "cause": "rc:3559804403",
     "status": "resolved"
    }
   ],
   "id": "rc:3559804403",
   "kind": "approach",
   "pin": null,
   "quote": "I'm not sure using gsl as a base makes sense for us. It seems very unlikely that this will ever be standardized, and we're already customizing it here quite a bit already. It seems like we don't care about the strict_not_null vs not_null separation, so we might as well avoid the complexity altogether?",
   "settled_by": {
    "at": "2026-07-17",
    "by": "maflcko",
    "id": "rc:3602420437",
    "quote": "it makes sense to just write a minimal, clean, and C++20 impl ourselves. So I went over all lines in your branch, applied some small test fixups, and then pushed it here."
   },
   "status": "resolved",
   "url": "https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34844#discussion_r3559804403"
  },
  {
   "association": "MEMBER",
   "at": "2026-07-22",
   "author": "stickies-v",
   "author_replies": [
